WEBVTT

00:00.248 --> 00:02.802
- [Voiceover] We're asked
to use the translation tool

00:02.802 --> 00:05.890
to determine the translation that will map

00:05.890 --> 00:08.559
triangle WIN, so this right over here,

00:08.559 --> 00:10.801
onto the other triangle.

00:10.801 --> 00:14.004
So let's see if we can
translate this thing.

00:14.004 --> 00:16.047
So I'm gonna use the translation tool.

00:16.047 --> 00:17.522
So I'm gonna start with the translation.

00:17.522 --> 00:20.042
So it says translate by,

00:20.042 --> 00:21.365
and this is gonna say so
how much do we translate

00:21.365 --> 00:22.606
the x coordinates, and how much

00:22.606 --> 00:24.462
do we translate the y coordinates?

00:24.462 --> 00:25.913
Let's see, if I want to map,

00:25.913 --> 00:29.187
if I want to get point W to correspond

00:29.187 --> 00:30.674
to this point right over here,

00:30.674 --> 00:32.392
which it seems like it should,

00:32.392 --> 00:35.109
I would have to go from x equals two,

00:35.109 --> 00:38.916
to x equals negative five.

00:38.916 --> 00:42.166
So my x would have to decrease by seven,

00:42.166 --> 00:43.688
so let me type that in.

00:43.688 --> 00:45.615
Negative seven,

00:45.615 --> 00:47.054
and then, let's see,

00:47.054 --> 00:49.979
on the y side, and we saw that,

00:49.979 --> 00:51.136
by just typing in negative seven,

00:51.136 --> 00:53.702
here we moved it to the left by seven.

00:53.702 --> 00:57.128
And now, in the y axis,

00:57.128 --> 00:59.183
I need to move it down by, let's see,

00:59.183 --> 01:01.237
one, two, three, four.

01:01.237 --> 01:04.720
So my y coordinates, I
move it down by four.

01:04.720 --> 01:06.136
And let's see.

01:06.136 --> 01:07.123
What happens?

01:07.123 --> 01:09.689
And it looks like I was able
to successfully translate it

01:09.689 --> 01:11.650
by translating x by negative seven,

01:11.650 --> 01:13.310
every point here, every point

01:13.310 --> 01:15.981
on this has been shifted
to the left by seven,

01:15.981 --> 01:18.071
and has been shifted down by four.

01:18.071 --> 01:20.381
And I was able to get onto this triangle.

01:20.381 --> 01:21.947
I was able to, through the translation,

01:21.947 --> 01:24.630
the image is now in kind
of that target triangle

01:24.630 --> 01:27.624
that they asked me to map to,

01:27.624 --> 01:29.180
to translate to.

01:29.180 --> 01:30.637
We got it right.
